Trouble is!

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.370
mawarumawaru chikkyu chiguhagu mirakuru

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.370
The spinning, spinning Earth's mismatched miracle

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.000
oikakekkoshiteru

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.000
Chasing after it

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.960
watashi watashi kokodesuyo

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.960
I am, I am over here!

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.380
mawarumawaru sekai anata ga yondemo

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.380
In this spinning, spinning world, even if you call

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:22.160
shiran kaoshichao tsukamacchattara makeyo

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:22.160
You lose if I catch you pretending to not know

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.820
mainichi mainichi ukiuki

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.820
Everyday, everyday cheery and happy

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.800
yattekita yattekita daisuki

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.800
You're here, you're here, I love you!

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.010
daisuki

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.010
I love you!

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:37.090
Draft

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:41.240
What have you done to your uniform?

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.360
It's against the rules!

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:47.120
Huh? What was that? I'm your senpai!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.080
I don't care if you're my senpai, you're still breaking the rules!

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.290
{}

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:56.040
With a principal like this around, why should I care about the rules?

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.760
Hey, you guys! Stolen underwear is the best!

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.710
You have a point, but...

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.110
But?

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:09.810
There's no use saying anything to someone like him, Kotegawa Yui.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.190
Yami-chan!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:16.460
Huh? What' s that? You got a problem too?

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.920
I don't care if you're an alien,

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:21.490
a kid scolding me is too much.

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.450
A kid?

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.290
That's right! A kid that's flat like a washboard!

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:30.950
Yami-chan...

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.720
I won't forget this!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:49.040
And that takes care of that.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:53.790
Yeah... well, I'll head back to the classroom.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.380
Yes.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:12.160
It's such a pain that so many people break the rules.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.450
Huh? It suddenly feels breezy.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.000
They're gone!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.660
Could it be...my underwear...

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.260
Back during that?

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:29.680
H-How could this be?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:35.250
This is bad. If people find out that I am not wearing underwear...

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.760
Yui, what a great job!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.780
Whoa, awesome!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:43.090
So you actually love to do perverted things.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.610
No panties? How does it feel?

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.450
You pervert!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.480
You're really lewd, Kotegawa. I am disappointed.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.990
Lewd!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.960
I don't want you to call me that!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.960
Kotegawa-san?

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:03.970
Haruna!

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.150
What's the matter? Your face looks red.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:10.620
Nothing! I have them put on just fine!

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:13.280
Put on? What do you mean?

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:17.120
Nothing! I'm busy!

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.180
K-Kotegawa-san!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.870
What's up with her?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:27.810
It's going to be troublesome if someone picked it up. I have to go pick it up!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.240
Oh, Yui!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.030
Where are you going?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.980
It has to be at the stairs.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.020
What's wrong, Kotegawa-kun?

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.380
You seem nervous about your skirt.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:46.340
Could it be that you wet your underwear and feel embarrassed?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:49.460
It's fine, we're both girls.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.390
That's right!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.260
Hold on!

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.720
Let's see.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.350
Feels hot!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:59.310
You pervert!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.660
She's always so ahead of herself.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.780
Right?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.790
The window's open. I'll have to watch for the breeze.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:19.870
Yo, Kotegawa!

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:24.230
Yuuki-kun, what are you doing here?!

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:28.270
I heard there's a cute dog running around the school.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:29.050
I-I see.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.910
Did he see it?

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.980
N-No way, it can't be.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.400
Oh, Lala. Did you find him?

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.640
Rito, the puppy's over there! Let's go!

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:47.170
I got it! Don't rush!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:50.950
Saruyama said that he saw him running there from the window!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.120
I need to hurry and get it back before I run into any more trouble!

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.580
It's not here!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:06.130
It's not here! It should be around here!

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:10.770
Could somebody have picked it up already? No way!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.970
Oh, this is wonderful!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:17.430
What nice scent and shape! I can't hold back!

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.260
C-Could it be?

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:24.410
Then, I won't hold myself back from this pan—

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:25.780
You pervert!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.650
Is there something wrong, Ma'am?

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:34.580
Why do you have bread?! I'm so confused!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.650
Oh, this loaf is delicious!

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:44.100
If you have any problems, just come have a nice little chat with me!

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:49.060
The scent of this loaf is really tempting! Do you want some?

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.360
I am fine!

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.470
Oh, she left!

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:57.700
He'll find out if I hang around him any longer! He was really scary!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:02.660
What's the matter, Kotegawa-san?

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.770
You're holding your skirt down.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.550
That's cute!

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.650
I-Is it?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.110
A dog?!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.770
A-A dog?

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:19.950
This is bad! Oshizu-chan is scared!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.630
What's wrong?

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:23.960
Puppy!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.330
What?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.880
Why are you running towards Oshizu-chan?!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:35.670
Oshizu-chan.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.250
Oshizu-chan, calm down!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.260
Kotegawa, are you alright?!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.970
At a place like this

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:58.950
Koteg—

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.600
Y-Yuuki-kun?

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.480
Rito!

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.910
I haven't have a chance to give the underwear back.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:22.090
I think I saw something extraordinary before I fainted.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:23.620
You...

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.550
You need to take responsibility!

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:42.520
Metamorphose

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:45.300
Really?

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:48.150
That's right! Just unbelievable, isn't it?

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:49.870
And then...

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.640
Then, see you tomorrow.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.130
Eh? Is your home that way, Mikan?

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:58.130
I need to buy the ingredients for dinner.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.340
I see. That must be tough.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.720
Nope, not at all.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.160
Hey, can you teach me how to cook something next time?

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.430
Me too!

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:10.430
Alright! Well, see you!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.060
See you tomorrow!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.760
Thank you.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:21.000
Okay, I'll make Rito's favorite fried chicken tonight.

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:27.740
What are you doing here?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.290
Mikan-san.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:34.880
I am scanning people passing by in order to collect more data for Lala-sama's clothing.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.910
So you've been doing things like this.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.590
It's about the time of year for new clothes.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.550
Then, where's Lala-san?

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:45.140
Go for it, Kyouko-san!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:49.150
I am nearly done with collecting data. Let's go home together.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.060
Yup.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.460
No way. A robber?!

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.260
Oh no, we lost him!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.260
My wallet's in that purse!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.670
Let's look for him from the sky.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:25.930
Eh? But how do I do it?

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.390
Am I right here no?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.260
Dress form!

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:58.630
This is really embarrassing.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:02.460
This isn't the time to worry about that! Let's hurry up!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.300
There he is! Mikan-san, over there!

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:11.970
Alright, let's get him!

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:16.770
This is not the time to be embarrassed, he'll get away.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:20.480
Alright! This is for our dinner{lit. the ingredients} and my wallet!

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:22.570
Hold it!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.090
Mikan is really amazing.

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:28.570
She's cute, she's smart, and she's good at housework.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.540
She's popular with the guys.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:35.290
That's nice. I want to be like Mikan-chan too.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.290
Stop right there!

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:43.300
M-Mikan just flew by in some weird outfit, didn't she?

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.720
So Mikan-chan can fly in the sky. That's wonderful.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:54.540
Wait! There, now give me back what you stole!

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.350
You pulled off my disguise!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.160
Right now!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.690
What are you doing, Peke?!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:17.590
I am sorry, I changed forms when I was hit.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.580
Just hurry and change back already!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:27.040
That was an alien just now, wasn't it?

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:31.560
He's a Hitakun, famous for his evil deeds.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.300
What... that's the worst...

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:36.270
What should I do to catch him?

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:39.850
If it's an alien we're going after, I have a good plan.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.660
What an arrogant kid.

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:50.280
But, Earthlings are...

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.320
way too absent-minded,

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.730
and that makes my job easy.

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:59.500
Oh! This is it!

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:02.710
Delicious!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:03.830
Found you.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.510
T-That black cloak.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.510
I am Konjiki no Yami.

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:16.470
I-If you want to live, give back what you've stolen.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.470
This is embarassing!

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:22.520
Konjiki no Yami? The legendary assassin?

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:26.230
Hey, are you trying to fool me?! Your hair isn't even gold!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.070
It didn't work after all, Peke!

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.110
Dammit, you had me scared!

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:32.280
You want a piece of me?

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:34.840
P-Peke, trans—

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.730
I can't do that!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:38.680
I'll show you!

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.460
What are you trying to do to my sister?!

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.920
Rito!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.790
Are you alright, Mikan?

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.010
Why are you here?

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:57.740
Dad sent me to buy him drawing materials. I thought I heard a noise.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.410
By the way, why are you cosplaying Yami?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.070
S-Something happened along the way.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.050
Uhh, I mean.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.730
Damn Earthlings.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:32.130
It's quite bold of you to shoot at my friend.

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:39.800
Yami-san!

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:45.030
Of course, by my friend, I meant Mikan.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.500
I know.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.270
So, what should we do about this guy?

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:54.640
Let's call Zastin-dono and turn him over to the galatic police.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.360
Is it really okay to let him live?

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:59.990
It's fine! I got back what he stole anyways.

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:05.860
Thanks a lot, Yami-san, Rito, and Peke.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:06.960
No problem. {added this -rakka}

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:08.710
By the way, Mikan.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.470
We're dressed the same.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:13.940
That's nice.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.890
The end.

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:30.930
Hand and Tail

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.650
Look, Rito!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:37.860
It's my bedroom! I've split my lab and cleaned it up for this!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.910
Wow.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.770
There's still a lot of useless stuff.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:53.530
For example, this thing.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.260
Let's see.

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.590
Rito?

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.590
Rito.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:12.000
That's my tail.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.970
Sorry! I grabbed it as I fell.

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:20.140
Hurry up and let go, Rito.

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:24.550
About that, my hand won't let go.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:30.170
Rito? Lala-san?

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.060
They aren't responding.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:41.470
How come Rito hasn't come back after Lala-san called him?

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.690
R-Rito!

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:46.630
Like this?

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:48.370
Not like that, Rito!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.620
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:56.960
B-Be more gentle like that.

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:00.380
Like this?

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:03.970
N-Not that!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.030
No way!

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:08.330
Rito, what are you doing in broad daylight?!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.030
Oh, Mikan.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:12.580
I can't take it off no matter what.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:24.590
After activating an item by mistake, Rito's hand is stuck to Lala-san's tail?

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:26.180
Yeah.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:32.180
This item creates a strong magnetic field in whatever touches it, resulting in a binding effect.

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:37.250
Since it was activated by mistake, I would guess the effect will wear off eventually.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:38.700
I see.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.360
S-Sorry!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:46.910
You can't do that. If you aren't gentle with me, I can feel it.

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.680
R-Right.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:51.250
Momo, Nana.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:55.010
Onee-sama, I envy—

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.670
It must be tough.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:01.670
Let me analyze that item a little.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:05.610
If it goes on like this, it will be quite a bother for Rito-san too.

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.010
I'll leave it to you, Momo!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.310
What?!

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:15.250
I did it!

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:19.070
Taken care of by burning, no matter what it is!

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:25.600
Gulp, gulp it down! Kyouge Juice!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:29.980
The point of these toilets is to save water. Don't use it like a shower.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.530
As if I would.

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:36.270
It absorbs urine three times better! This way you can find your puppy a seat!

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:37.990
Hey, Rito.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:39.240
Umm.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.060
What is it?

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:44.430
I want to go to the restroom.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.880
Don't peek no matter what.

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:51.030
Rito-dono.

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:55.470
Wear this. It can completely obscure your vision and other senses.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.190
How long do I have to wear this?

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:05.730
Dinner's ready!

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.740
It's delicious!

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:10.800
Sorry, Mikan-san. You even had to serve us dinner.

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:15.490
It's nothing! It tastes better with more people, and it's more fun making it!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:22.540
Of course it's taro root, of all things.

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:30.580
Dammit. I can't eat it very well with my left hand.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.290
Rito, here.

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.080
Oww!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.110
Sorry, Rito!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.610
Towel! Get the towel!

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:03.050
Rito, pass me the soap.

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:06.530
Come on! At least hide it!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.680
If you hold it that hard...

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:19.880
What is that noise?

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:28.150
What are you trying to do to my sister at a time like this?!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.920
You got it wrong!

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:36.380
We even need to sleep together.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.220
That's because it still won't come off.

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:49.650
I'm used to seeing Lala in my bed when I wake up,

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:53.020
but this really is the first time like this.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:54.740
Hey, Rito.

00:20:55.430 --> 00:21:00.250
It was tough, but I'm really happy that we spent the whole day together.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.390
I think it's fine if we stay like this.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.480
What are you talking about?

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:11.150
I'm kidding. Good night.

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:33.000
I couldn't sleep after all.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:36.850
At least Lala didn't get into her dreams enough to start stripping or anything.

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:40.130
Inside the bed {or futon if you'd like}

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:46.250
It's gone! The effect wore off!

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:49.610
Yeah!

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.050
Oh, Rito-san.

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:57.500
I'm sorry, but I couldn't figure out that thing's composition in the end.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:59.620
It's fine! It came off fine after all!

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:11.240
This time Celine-chan got stuck to Rito?!

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:13.950
Spare me.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:41.270
tamerawa naide gomakasa naide

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:41.270
Please don't hesitate, please don't trick me.

00:22:42.100 --> 00:22:47.190
docchi ga suki nano icchatte

00:22:42.100 --> 00:22:47.190
Say it, who do you love?

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:53.410
ibu ga futari ni adamu wa hitori

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:53.410
Two Eves and one Adam

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:58.900
rakuen ni wa arashi no yokan

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:58.900
It feels like there is going to be a storm in heaven.

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:06.110
madamada suppai wagamama na kajitsu nano

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:06.110
It's a selfish and still sour fruit

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.670
kuchibiru yoseru tabi

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.670
To get you to put it against your lips…

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:13.540
hazukashii hodo I WANT YOU

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:13.540
To the point that it's embarrassing, I WANT YOU

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:17.850
gaburi

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:17.850
Gulp!

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:23.940
kajitte goranyo hayaku hayaku

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:23.940
Bite it and see! Hurry, hurry

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:29.490
amai kaori ni kurakura shichau kamo

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:29.490
You might get dizzy from the sweet smell

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:35.800
tuyoku kande hagata wa haato maaku

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:35.800
Bite it hard and your teeth marks leave a heart-impression

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:38.830
shirarecha ikenai

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:38.830
You mustn't know

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:41.710
ringo wa hitotsu shikanaiyo

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:41.710
There is only one apple.
